  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - On 6 May 2026, the proposal as shown on the drawing(s) submitted on 06 May 2026 and numbered A00, A01, A02, A03, A11, A12, A13 was not lawful within the meanings of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990. \r\n\r\nThe development fails to comply with the terms of Class A(j)(iii) of Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).\r\n",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed first floor rear extension involves a net increase of rear flank elevation of 0.4m instead of an infill extension. As the proposed first floor extension links to a proposed ground floor extension which is not original house, total enlargement of the house would then consist of more than one storey. The proposed extension is within 2m of boundary with an eaves height  4.79m, which fails to comply with Clause (i) of Class A Part 1 of Schedule 2 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015. "
